 "description": "Jung lagi keel se tetanus hota hai? Nahi! Asli villain hai mitti mein rehne wala Clostridium tetani — aur uska zeher tetanospasmin, duniya ke sabse potent toxins mein se ek.\n\nIs video mein MBBS-level detail: drumstick appearance, obligate anaerobe, retrograde axonal transport, GABA/glycine block, trismus, risus sardonicus, opisthotonus — aur kyun tetanus hone ke baad bhi immunity nahi milti.\n\n💬 Comment \"TETANUS\" — free 1-page tetanus notes DM mein!\n📤 Share karo us dost ko jo abhi bhi sochta hai jung se tetanus hota hai.\n\nSources: CDC Pink Book, Chapter 21 (Tetanus); CDC Clinical Overview of Tetanus; Ananthanarayan & Paniker's Textbook of Microbiology; MoHFW Td vaccine guidelines (UIP).",
